  updatedBy: "Salomo Putra Glorious Hokoyoku (Project Manager, Backend)", team: "Kelompok Jaran Goyang – reviewer keterujian: Steven Wibisana",
  refs: "SRS-DDB-001 v0.1 (Bagian 3); SAD-DDB-001 v0.9.1; backend/docs/openapi.json (73 operasi); kode backend dan Android per 11 November 2026",
  date: "11 November 2026", logo: LOGO,
